  "title": "Asian-Style Shrimp Scampi",
  "description": "This Asian-style shrimp scampi recipe is cooked with ginger paste, garlic, lime, and soy sauce. It is served over spaghetti for a quick weeknight meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
